    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d367-a1">

                <pb facs="0590" n="520" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg520"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>Department of Foreign Relations and Government–Department of Relations–Section
                    America, number 544.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chihuahua,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-12-09"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 9, 1866</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>To-morrow the government will leave this city for Durango, and I will duly
                    communicate to you the day of arrival there.</p>
                <p>I have previously informed you how you can direct your future correspondence.</p>
                <p>I assure you of my respecttul consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>LERDO DE TEJADA.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Citizen <hi rendition="#small-caps">Romero,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Envoy Extraordinary and Minister
                            Plenipotentiary.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
